# execution | scope | task | task summary | sourceRevision | context SHA | constraints | mandatory gates | outcome | expected label | expected acceptance | expected eligibility reasons
# outcome: ACCEPTED_VALIDATED:<attempt ordinal> | ACCEPTED_IMPORTED:<attempt ordinal> | REJECTED_VALIDATED | CANCELLED | NONE
# Expected label, acceptance and eligibility reasons are judged by hand from contract v1 sections 8 and 21.4; they are
# the raw per-execution values the export must carry, never reinterpreted per attempt. '-' = eligible (SUCCESS, FAILURE).
# Recording order is file order; m-correct is followed by m-twin-ko so that the cutoff (manifest) falls between them.
